<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contact Us - NEET Quiz Hub</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --soft-rose: #f7e8eb;
            --misty-lavender: #e8e3f0;
            --periwinkle-mist: #e2e7f5;
            --slate-blue: #4b5d73;
            --text-main: #2d3436;
            --surface: #ffffff;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--misty-lavender) 0%, var(--periwinkle-mist) 50%, var(--soft-rose) 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: var(--surface);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(75, 93, 115, 0.08);
        }
        h1 { color: var(--slate-blue); margin-top: 0; }
        a { color: var(--slate-blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p>Have questions, feedback, or found an issue in any of our quiz questions? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
        
        <p>You can reach out to us directly via email:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> support@neetquizhub.com</p>
        
        <p>We typically respond within 24-48 hours.</p>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 40px;"><a href="index.html">&larr; Back to Home</a></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
